cf","summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"I can do that, but I need you to confirm exactly what you want before I touch your mailbox.\n\nQuick definitions (so we’re clear):\n- Archive = remove the Inbox label so messages stay in All Mail and are searchable; reversible at any time.  \n- Delete = move to Trash (recoverable for 30 days), then permanently removed after 30 days; permanent deletion after that is irreversible.\n\nPlease confirm all of the following (copy/edit one of the example confirmation lines or write your own):\n\n1) Action: Archive or Delete?  \n2) Exact target sender: noreply@transitalerts.net — is that correct, and do you want to include emails that only mention that address (e.g., in CC) or strictly From: that address?  \n3) Scope (choose one or specify):  \n   - All messages from that sender in your account  \n   - Only messages in Inbox  \n   - Only messages older than N days (e.g., 90 days)  \n   - Only messages before YYYY-MM-DD  \n   - Exclude starred or unread messages (optional)  \n4) Do you want a preview first (I’ll list how many messages match and show up to 20 subject/date lines) before I perform the action? (Preview requires reading your mailbox and will be shown before any destructive step.)\n\nExamples you can copy and send back:\n- \"Yes — Archive all messages From:noreply@transitalerts.net in Inbox older than 90 days. Preview first: yes.\"  \n- \"Yes — Delete all messages From:noreply@transitalerts.net across all labels before 2025-01-01. Preview first: no.\"  \n\nI will not run anything until you confirm exactly as above.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_04c537bc6e05a07c016a9be470257487d0b4772453c641594b","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"in_memory","reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":n